<!--
Worktree Sweep backstop - macOS launchd configuration

INSTALLATION (recommended):
  cd dev-agents
  make worktree-sweep-install

This will:
  - Copy this plist to ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
  - Load it with launchctl

After installation the sweep runs once a day and does two things:
  1. removes worktrees and local branches of the olympus-platform checkout
     whose PR has already merged (make worktree-sweep-apply there);
  2. removes per-seat worktrees and per-dispatch launcher runtimes that
     scripts/run-remote.sh keeps under ~/dev and that are older than a day
     (make seat-worktree-sweep-apply in dev-agents; a live seat is never
     touched).
scripts/land.sh runs both sweeps at the end of every landing; this is the
backstop for runs that never land.

The olympus checkout comes from OLYMPUS_ROOT and the dev-agents checkout from
DEV_AGENTS_ROOT, both defaulting to the same dev-projects/AI-Orchestration
parent the PR Sentinel plist points at. Override with:
  launchctl setenv OLYMPUS_ROOT /path/to/olympus-platform
  launchctl setenv DEV_AGENTS_ROOT /path/to/dev-agents

RunAtLoad is deliberately false: installing the backstop should not start
deleting branches at that same moment. The first run is one interval later.

USEFUL COMMANDS:
  launchctl list | grep worktree-sweep
  tail -f ~/Library/Logs/worktree-sweep.log
  make worktree-sweep-uninstall

Log file: ~/Library/Logs/worktree-sweep.log

-->
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.arlen.worktree-sweep</string>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/bin/zsh</string>
        <string>-c</string>
        <string>cd "${OLYMPUS_ROOT:-/Users/arlenrios/Desktop/dev-projects/AI-Orchestration/olympus-platform}" &amp;&amp; make worktree-sweep-apply &gt;&gt; ~/Library/Logs/worktree-sweep.log 2&gt;&amp;1; cd "${DEV_AGENTS_ROOT:-/Users/arlenrios/Desktop/dev-projects/AI-Orchestration/dev-agents}" &amp;&amp; make seat-worktree-sweep-apply &gt;&gt; ~/Library/Logs/worktree-sweep.log 2&gt;&amp;1</string>
    </array>

    <key>StartInterval</key>
    <integer>86400</integer>   <!-- once a day -->

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <false/>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/arlenrios/Library/Logs/worktree-sweep.log</string>

    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/arlenrios/Library/Logs/worktree-sweep.log</string>

    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    </dict>
</dict>
</plist>
